{"slug":"keluarga","category":"Keluarga","source":{"title":"Indeks Tematik","author":"Ustadz Muhammad Thalib","url":"https://quran.tarjamahtafsiriyah.com/"},"subtopics":[{"subtopic":null,"entries":[{"text":"Manusia ditetapkan hidup berjodoh","ref":"QS. Fatir, 35:11","refs":[{"surah":35,"ayah":11,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala"]}]},{"text":"Pasangan fitrah manusia adalah laki-laki & perempuan","ref":"QS. Al-Qiyamah, 75:39","refs":[{"surah":75,"ayah":39,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]}]},{"text":"Suami pemimpin keluarga, istri wakilnya","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:34","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":34,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Suami istri punya tanggung jawab seimbang","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:228","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":228,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Istri ladang bagi suami","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:223","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":223,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Memaafkan kekurangan istri & anak","ref":"QS. At-Taghabun, 64:14","refs":[{"surah":64,"ayah":14,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Kewajiban anak berbakti pada orang tua","ref":"QS. Al-Isra, 17:23","refs":[{"surah":17,"ayah":23,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Menyusui anak sampai dua tahun","ref":"QS. Luqman, 31:14","refs":[{"surah":31,"ayah":14,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["muhammad-shallallahu-alaihi-wasallam","perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Jangan membenci anak perempuan","ref":"QS. An-Nahl, 16:57–59","refs":[{"surah":16,"ayah":57,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]},{"surah":16,"ayah":58,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]},{"surah":16,"ayah":59,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Menikah untuk ketenteraman jiwa","ref":"QS. Al-A’raf, 7:189","refs":[{"surah":7,"ayah":189,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]}]},{"text":"Cinta sejati hanya dalam pernikahan","ref":"QS. Ar-Rum, 30:21","refs":[{"surah":30,"ayah":21,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Membantu orang miskin menikah","ref":"QS. An-Nur, 24:32","refs":[{"surah":24,"ayah":32,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala"]}]},{"text":"Pernikahan salah satu jalan mendapat rezeki","ref":"QS. Al-A’raf, 7:190","refs":[{"surah":7,"ayah":190,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]}]},{"text":"Dilarang adopsi anak","ref":"QS. Al-Ahzab, 33:4","refs":[{"surah":33,"ayah":4,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala","perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Suami istri gembira mendapat anak normal","ref":"QS. Al-A’raf, 7:190","refs":[{"surah":7,"ayah":190,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]}]},{"text":"Haram menikahi ibu tiri","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:22","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":22,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Perempuan baik untuk laki-laki baik","ref":"QS. An-Nur, 24:26","refs":[{"surah":24,"ayah":26,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["membangun-pribadi-shalih"]}]},{"text":"Ada istri salehah & ada yang durhaka","ref":"QS. At-Tahrim, 66:10–11","refs":[{"surah":66,"ayah":10,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala"]},{"surah":66,"ayah":11,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["muhammad-shallallahu-alaihi-wasallam"]}]},{"text":"Harmoni rumah tangga bisa dirusak pihak lain","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:102","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":102,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]}]},{"text":"Suami boleh mentalak istri karena sebab tertentu","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:227–228","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":227,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]},{"surah":2,"ayah":228,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Talak yang bisa rujuk hanya dua kali","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:229","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":229,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Perempuan ditalak tidak boleh dihalangi menikah lagi","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:231–232","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":231,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]},{"surah":2,"ayah":232,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Suami tidak boleh meminta kembali mahar","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:20","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":20,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Istri yang ditalak berhak pesangon","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:236–237","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":236,"resolvable":true,"bridge":[]},{"surah":2,"ayah":237,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Suami wajib menyediakan rumah","ref":"QS. At-Talaq, 65:6","refs":[{"surah":65,"ayah":6,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Suami wajib membiayai istri sesuai kemampuan","ref":"QS. At-Talaq, 65:7","refs":[{"surah":65,"ayah":7,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala","prinsip-prinsip-pendidikan-islam","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Istri hamil berhak nafkah sampai melahirkan","ref":"QS. At-Talaq, 65:6","refs":[{"surah":65,"ayah":6,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Wajib tunjuk mediator bijak bila berselisih","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:35","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":35,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Haram membunuh anak karena takut miskin","ref":"QS. Al-An’am, 6:151","refs":[{"surah":6,"ayah":151,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala","perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Menyapih anak dengan musyawarah","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:233","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":233,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Cerai bukanlah aib dalam keluarga","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:130","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":130,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala"]}]},{"text":"Anak hiburan & kebanggaan orang tua","ref":"QS. Al-Hadid, 57:20","refs":[{"surah":57,"ayah":20,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Kerabat dekat saling membantu","ref":"QS. Al-Ahzab, 33:6","refs":[{"surah":33,"ayah":6,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["muhammad-shallallahu-alaihi-wasallam","hijrah-jihad-dan-perang","membangun-pribadi-shalih"]}]},{"text":"Anak dinisbatkan kepada ayahnya","ref":"QS. Al-Ahzab, 33:5","refs":[{"surah":33,"ayah":5,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan","karakteristik-negara-bersyari-ah"]}]},{"text":"Orang menjelang mati wajib berwasiat","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:240","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":240,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Anak saleh akan berkumpul dengan orang tuanya di surga","ref":"QS. At-Tur, 52:21","refs":[{"surah":52,"ayah":21,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala"]}]},{"text":"Jangan abaikan masa depan anak lemah","ref":"QS. An-Nisa, 4:9","refs":[{"surah":4,"ayah":9,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Wajib berbuat baik pada anak yatim","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:83","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":83,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]},{"text":"Anak usia 40 sadar hutang budi pada orang tua","ref":"QS. Al-Ahqaf, 46:15","refs":[{"surah":46,"ayah":15,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["allah-subhanahu-wa-ta-ala","rahasia-kejiwaan-manusia-dalam-al-qur-an"]}]},{"text":"Besar dosanya mengkhianati wasiat orang mati","ref":"QS. Al-Baqarah, 2:181","refs":[{"surah":2,"ayah":181,"resolvable":true,"bridge":["perintah-dan-larangan"]}]}]}]}